OL,3,GNEWSA'I will be a WWE champion': Meet
OL,4,Athe young wrestlers dreaming big
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor many wrestling fans growing up
OL,7,Fmeant watching stars like The Rock,
OL,8,FStone Cold Steve Austin and John Cena
OL,9,Fon television.
OL,11,FBut for anyone who dreamed of following
OL,12,Fin their footsteps, making it into the
OL,13,Findustry could feel a world away.
OL,15,FNow, those involved in the sport say
OL,16,Fopportunities are growing closer to
OL,17,Fhome, giving aspiring wrestlers a
OL,18,Fchance to train, perform and begin
OL,19,Fbuilding a career.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
